c-PJLV-hzPoUZ-spacing-8"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-dCpVsf-spacing-6 c-fixGjY-JrrAq-align-start c-PJLV-ihQBGWd-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-fVlWzK-spacing-3"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-eKWVTQ-spacing-5 c-fixGjY-JrrAq-align-start c-PJLV-ieDKBsk-css"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-erPqIQ-kDozXu-size-7">Why integrate with Ashby<span class="c-kOcYLz"><span data-anchor-link="icon" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-JHdOu-color-gray c-fvJrVK-igOuQS-css"><svg aria-hidden="true" data-prefix="far" data-icon="link" class="link_svg__svg-inline--fa link_svg__fa-link link_svg__fa-w-16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M314.222 197.78c51.091 51.091 54.377 132.287 9.75 187.16-6.242 7.73-2.784 3.865-84.94 86.02-54.696 54.696-143.266 54.745-197.99 0-54.711-54.69-54.734-143.255 0-197.99 32.773-32.773 51.835-51.899 63.409-63.457 7.463-7.452 20.331-2.354 20.486 8.192a173.31 173.31 0 004.746 37.828c.966 4.029-.272 8.269-3.202 11.198L80.632 312.57c-32.755 32.775-32.887 85.892 0 118.8 32.775 32.755 85.892 32.887 118.8 0l75.19-75.2c32.718-32.725 32.777-86.013 0-118.79a83.722 83.722 0 00-22.814-16.229c-4.623-2.233-7.182-7.25-6.561-12.346 1.356-11.122 6.296-21.885 14.815-30.405l4.375-4.375c3.625-3.626 9.177-4.594 13.76-2.294 12.999 6.524 25.187 15.211 36.025 26.049zM470.958 41.04c-54.724-54.745-143.294-54.696-197.99 0-82.156 82.156-78.698 78.29-84.94 86.02-44.627 54.873-41.341 136.069 9.75 187.16 10.838 10.838 23.026 19.525 36.025 26.049 4.582 2.3 10.134 1.331 13.76-2.294l4.375-4.375c8.52-8.519 13.459-19.283 14.815-30.405.621-5.096-1.938-10.113-6.561-12.346a83.706 83.706 0 01-22.814-16.229c-32.777-32.777-32.718-86.065 0-118.79l75.19-75.2c32.908-32.887 86.025-32.755 118.8 0 32.887 32.908 32.755 86.025 0 118.8l-45.848 45.84c-2.93 2.929-4.168 7.169-3.202 11.198a173.31 173.31 0 014.746 37.828c.155 10.546 13.023 15.644 20.486 8.192 11.574-11.558 30.636-30.684 63.409-63.457 54.733-54.735 54.71-143.3-.001-197.991z"></path></svg></span></span></h2><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-hSaSvL-iMVRpC-size-3">We designed our open API and partner ecosystem as first-class products, making it faster, easier, and more rewarding for partners to create integrations that customers love.</p></div></div></div><div class="c-iryTww"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ikfsarZ-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-igNapgy-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ifRYmVR-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/bb468b3810/union-horiz-alt.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-iiIgCBp-css"/></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-idqbfRx-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/bb468b3810/union-horiz-alt.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-ihCEltV-css"/><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/bb468b3810/union-horiz-alt.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-idaalZk-css"/></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-llVfQI-spacing-1"><h5 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-hxpFjM-size-3 c-PJLV-ibFVHWT-css">Open, modern API</h5><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-cBLpOj-size-2">Ashby&#x27;s open API is a core product, designed with the same principles as the rest of the platform. </p></div></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ikfsarZ-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-igNapgy-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ifRYmVR-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x25/a46132aafe/rocket-01.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-iiIgCBp-css"/></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-idqbfRx-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x25/a46132aafe/rocket-01.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-ihCEltV-css"/><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x25/a46132aafe/rocket-01.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-idaalZk-css"/></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-llVfQI-spacing-1"><h5 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-hxpFjM-size-3 c-PJLV-ibFVHWT-css">Fast, developer-friendly experience</h5><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-cBLpOj-size-2">Extensive documentation, consistent data structures, and a dedicated team of integration experts reduces time-to-build.</p></div></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ikfsarZ-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-igNapgy-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ifRYmVR-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/9a98e3ef50/heart.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-iiIgCBp-css"/></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-idqbfRx-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/9a98e3ef50/heart.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-ihCEltV-css"/><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/9a98e3ef50/heart.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-idaalZk-css"/></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-llVfQI-spacing-1"><h5 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-hxpFjM-size-3 c-PJLV-ibFVHWT-css">Build deeper connections</h5><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-cBLpOj-size-2">Because Ashby unifies ATS, CRM, scheduling, and analytics, an integration can live across multiple workflows.</p></div></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ikfsarZ-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-igNapgy-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ifRYmVR-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/2143cfc2b1/page-edit.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-iiIgCBp-css"/></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-idqbfRx-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/2143cfc2b1/page-edit.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-ihCEltV-css"/><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/2143cfc2b1/page-edit.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-idaalZk-css"/></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-llVfQI-spacing-1"><h5 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-hxpFjM-size-3 c-PJLV-ibFVHWT-css">Fast and responsive</h5><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-cBLpOj-size-2">We move quickly, helping partners go to market in weeks, not months.</p></div></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ikfsarZ-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-igNapgy-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ifRYmVR-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/5a70e244df/agile.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-iiIgCBp-css"/></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-idqbfRx-css"><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/5a70e244df/agile.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-ihCEltV-css"/><img src="https://a-us.storyblok.com/f/1017310/24x24/5a70e244df/agile.svg" alt="" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-idaalZk-css"/></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-llVfQI-spacing-1"><h5 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-hxpFjM-size-3 c-PJLV-ibFVHWT-css">High-demand ecosystem</h5><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-cBLpOj-size-2">We actively spotlight partners in high-demand areas of our ecosystem. </p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-eRbzmG-size-3 c-PJLV-kOImUX-bg-white"><div class="c-durDQG c-PJLV c-PJLV-dzcdLJ-size-default"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kJJwbO-spacing-7 c-PJLV-hzPoUZ-spacing-8"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-dCpVsf-spacing-6 c-fixGjY-JrrAq-align-start c-PJLV-ihQBGWd-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-fVlWzK-spacing-3"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-PJLV-ixnjYu-color-primary c-erPqIQ-diBRkq-size-4">Working with our team</h2><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-eKWVTQ-spacing-5 c-fixGjY-JrrAq-align-start c-PJLV-ieDKBsk-css"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-erPqIQ-kDozXu-size-7">Integration process<span class="c-kOcYLz"><span data-anchor-link="icon" class="c-fvJrVK c-fvJrVK-JHdOu-color-gray c-fvJrVK-igOuQS-css"><svg aria-hidden="true" data-prefix="far" data-icon="link" class="link_svg__svg-inline--fa link_svg__fa-link link_svg__fa-w-16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M314.222 197.78c51.091 51.091 54.377 132.287 9.75 187.16-6.242 7.73-2.784 3.865-84.94 86.02-54.696 54.696-143.266 54.745-197.99 0-54.711-54.69-54.734-143.255 0-197.99 32.773-32.773 51.835-51.899 63.409-63.457 7.463-7.452 20.331-2.354 20.486 8.192a173.31 173.31 0 004.746 37.828c.966 4.029-.272 8.269-3.202 11.198L80.632 312.57c-32.755 32.775-32.887 85.892 0 118.8 32.775 32.755 85.892 32.887 118.8 0l75.19-75.2c32.718-32.725 32.777-86.013 0-118.79a83.722 83.722 0 00-22.814-16.229c-4.623-2.233-7.182-7.25-6.561-12.346 1.356-11.122 6.296-21.885 14.815-30.405l4.375-4.375c3.625-3.626 9.177-4.594 13.76-2.294 12.999 6.524 25.187 15.211 36.025 26.049zM470.958 41.04c-54.724-54.745-143.294-54.696-197.99 0-82.156 82.156-78.698 78.29-84.94 86.02-44.627 54.873-41.341 136.069 9.75 187.16 10.838 10.838 23.026 19.525 36.025 26.049 4.582 2.3 10.134 1.331 13.76-2.294l4.375-4.375c8.52-8.519 13.459-19.283 14.815-30.405.621-5.096-1.938-10.113-6.561-12.346a83.706 83.706 0 01-22.814-16.229c-32.777-32.777-32.718-86.065 0-118.79l75.19-75.2c32.908-32.887 86.025-32.755 118.8 0 32.887 32.908 32.755 86.025 0 118.8l-45.848 45.84c-2.93 2.929-4.168 7.169-3.202 11.198a173.31 173.31 0 014.746 37.828c.155 10.546 13.023 15.644 20.486 8.192 11.574-11.558 30.636-30.684 63.409-63.457 54.733-54.735 54.71-143.3-.001-197.991z"></path></svg></span></span></h2><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-hSaSvL-iMVRpC-size-3">We have a simple and streamlined integration process for prospective partners. After you reach out to us, here’s what to expect:</p></div></div></div><div class="c-lesPJm"><div class="fresnel-container fresnel-lessThan-mobile fresnel-:R2qupm: c-PJLV"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kJJwbO-spacing-7 c-PJLV-hzPoUZ-spacing-8"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1646" height="1148" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="c-PJLV c-PJLV-igQshsv-css" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa-us.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F1017310%2F1646x1148%2Fcd96b3a221%2Fdevelopment-cycles.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa-us.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F1017310%2F1646x1148%2Fcd96b3a221%2Fdevelopment-cycles.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa-us.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F1017310%2F1646x1148%2Fcd96b3a221%2Fdevelopment-cycles.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-dCpVsf-spacing-6"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kdofoX-spacing-2"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-diBRkq-size-4">Introduction call</h2><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-iMVRpC-size-3">We’ll reach out to schedule an introduction call. This helps us learn more about you, what you’re building, and how your product fits into our customers’ workflows. If we determine it’s not a fit, we’ll be transparent about why.

At this stage, we like to see that you have a solution that’s built and will be a seamless experience for integrating customers. 
</p></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-dCpVsf-spacing-6"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kdofoX-spacing-2"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-diBRkq-size-4">Agreement and access</h2><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-iMVRpC-size-3">Once we’ve validated your product and workflow, we’ll go through a legal review process. Once approved, we’ll provide a sandbox and technical support contacts.</p></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-dCpVsf-spacing-6"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kdofoX-spacing-2"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-diBRkq-size-4">Build</h2><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-iMVRpC-size-3">We’ll support you throughout the build for any technical or workflow questions.</p></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-dCpVsf-spacing-6"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kdofoX-spacing-2"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-diBRkq-size-4">Validation and testing</h2><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-iMVRpC-size-3">Once ready, you’ll demo the integration end-to-end for our team on a live call.</p></div></div><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-dCpVsf-spacing-6"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-kdofoX-spacing-2"><h2 class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-erPqIQ-diBRkq-size-4">Marketplace go-live</h2><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-hSaSvL-iMVRpC-size-3">After your demo is approved, we’ll collect support and marketing assets to publish you on our Marketplace. All new partners are featured in our monthly customer newsletter via email and LinkedIn.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="fresnel-container fresnel-greaterThanOrEqual-mobile fresnel-:R3aupm: c-PJLV"><div aria-live="polite" aria-role="region" class="c-PJLV c-iSwBqf c-PJLV-kJJwbO-spacing-7 c-iSwBqf-knmidH-justify-between c-iSwBqf-JrrAq-align-start c-iSwBqf-kVNAnR-nowrap-true"><div class="c-PJLV c-fixGjY c-PJLV-eKWVTQ-spacing-5 c-PJLV-igkcTbG-css"><button style="z-index:0" id=":R5raupmH2:" role="tab" aria-labelledby=":R5raupm:" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls=":R5raupmH1: :Rbaupm:" class="c-cKrAvE c-KRFbF c-KRFbF-eHrnxa-disabled-true"><div class="c-iVzzNt"><div class="c-kNCLoP"><div class="c-kZTYrS"></div></div><h2 id=":R5raupm:" class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-fbeSWw c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-PJLV-hJuKPH-color-heading c-erPqIQ-hxpFjM-size-3">Introduction call</h2><div id=":R5raupmH1:" aria-hidden="false" role="tabpanel" style="grid-area:body;overflow:hidden;opacity:1;height:auto;margin-bottom:$2;will-change:opacity" class="c-lesPJm"><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-wOnhB c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-hSaSvL-cBLpOj-size-2">We’ll reach out to schedule an introduction call. This helps us learn more about you, what you’re building, and how your product fits into our customers’ workflows. If we determine it’s not a fit, we’ll be transparent about why.

At this stage, we like to see that you have a solution that’s built and will be a seamless experience for integrating customers. 
</p></div></div></button><button style="z-index:1" id=":R9raupmH2:" role="tab" aria-labelledby=":R9raupm:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls=":R9raupmH1: :Rbaupm:" class="c-cKrAvE c-KRFbF"><div class="c-iVzzNt"><div class="c-kNCLoP c-kNCLoP-dHrmsm-appearance-selectableHidingOthers"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M6 1C6 0.447715 5.55229 0 5 0C4.44772 0 4 0.447716 4 1V4H1C0.447715 4 0 4.44771 0 5C0 5.55228 0.447715 6 1 6H4V9C4 9.55228 4.44771 10 5 10C5.55228 10 6 9.55228 6 9V6H9C9.55228 6 10 5.55228 10 5C10 4.44771 9.55228 4 9 4H6V1Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><h2 id=":R9raupm:" class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-fbeSWw c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-PJLV-djcNJv-color-dark c-erPqIQ-hxpFjM-size-3">Agreement and access</h2><div id=":R9raupmH1:" aria-hidden="true" role="tabpanel" style="grid-area:body;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;height:0px;margin-bottom:0;will-change:opacity" class="c-lesPJm"><p class="c-PJLV c-hSaSvL c-wOnhB c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-hSaSvL-cBLpOj-size-2">Once we’ve validated your product and workflow, we’ll go through a legal review process. Once approved, we’ll provide a sandbox and technical support contacts.</p></div></div></button><button style="z-index:2" id=":RdraupmH2:" role="tab" aria-labelledby=":Rdraupm:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls=":RdraupmH1: :Rbaupm:" class="c-cKrAvE c-KRFbF"><div class="c-iVzzNt"><div class="c-kNCLoP c-kNCLoP-dHrmsm-appearance-selectableHidingOthers"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M6 1C6 0.447715 5.55229 0 5 0C4.44772 0 4 0.447716 4 1V4H1C0.447715 4 0 4.44771 0 5C0 5.55228 0.447715 6 1 6H4V9C4 9.55228 4.44771 10 5 10C5.55228 10 6 9.55228 6 9V6H9C9.55228 6 10 5.55228 10 5C10 4.44771 9.55228 4 9 4H6V1Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><h2 id=":Rdraupm:" class="c-PJLV c-erPqIQ c-fbeSWw c-PJLV-iEekSg-balance-true c-PJLV-djcNJv-color-dark c-erPqIQ-hxpFjM